        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 1990 European Cup Final\n- Organizations: Milan, Benfica\n- People: Frank Rijkaard, Marco van Basten\n- Places: Italy, Portugal\n- Roles: footballer, manager, midfielder, defender\n\nFacts:\n- The 1990 European Cup Final was a football match played on 23 May 1990 between Milan of Italy and Benfica of Portugal.\n- Milan scored the winning goal in the 68th minute when Frank Rijkaard passed to Marco van Basten, Marco van Basten returned the ball to Frank Rijkaard, and Frank Rijkaard ran through the defense and scored.\n- Frank Rijkaard is Franklin Edmundo \"Frank\" Rijkaard.\n- Frank Rijkaard is a Dutch former footballer and former manager.\n- Frank Rijkaard played as a midfielder or defender.",
